    end_mask: An `int32` mask.
    ellipsis_mask: An `int32` mask.
    new_axis_mask: An `int32` mask.
    shrink_axis_mask: An `int32` mask.
    var: The variable corresponding to `input_` or None
    name: A name for the operation (optional).

